            <li><strong>Erhu, pipa, guzheng, dizi, sheng</strong>. When prompt tags say "Chinese instruments", do your ears actually hear them?</li>
            <li><strong>A/B version comparisons</strong>: strictly audible vs. inaudible, not personal taste.</li>
